{"review_id": "daf1d668-acdd-455d-9105-e5a26c4fa391", "package": "com.habitnow", "app_name": "HabitNow Daily Routine Planner", "language": "sr", "language_name": "sr", "rating": 4, "text": "How do I change habits to everyday?", "author": "Google корисник", "date": "2019-11-17T10:53:48Z", "thumbs_up": 2, "app_version": "1.2.1", "developer_reply": "Hi Igor: To change a habit schedule is needed to create a new one. We are working to add an edit option. At the moment it is not possible because changing a habit schedule would affect the recorded statistics. We are working to fix it as soon as possible. Thanks for contacting us. Regards, HabitNow Team"}
